    <fr:title text="Kleene Star in Dependent Lambek Calculus">Kleene Star in Dependent Lambek Calculus</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>definition</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>For a grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex>, the Kleene star <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[{A}^{*}]]></fr:tex> is defined as a least-fixed point,

  <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[\mu  x . \epsilon  \oplus  {\mathopen {}\left (A \otimes  x\right )\mathclose {}}]]></fr:tex></html:p>
    <html:p>In Dependent Lambek Calculus, it is derivable that <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[{A}^{*} \cong  \mu  x . \epsilon  \oplus  {\mathopen {}\left (x \otimes  A\right )\mathclose {}}]]></fr:tex>.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
